The endpoint does not fetch by a user-controlled identifier (no IDOR), it has authentication/authorization (not missing), and the scope check is correct (not incorrect). The fact that it exposes all orders' `user_id`/`shipping_address` is the documented behavior of the report endpoint, not a policy violation. No authorization flaw is established by the changed lines.

